<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average 76.58 to 7008.20.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.74 to 424.48.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.36.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1482 to 1031.</p>
<p>Volume was 459,910,840 compared with 478,296,040 on Friday.</p>
